@HostAddress = http://localhost:5148
@ApiKey = YOUR_API_KEY_HERE
@Token = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### ===== PROJECT SETUP =====

### 1. Create Project (no auth needed) → save apiKey from response
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "My App",
  "slug": "my-app"
}

### ===== USER REGISTRATION & LOGIN =====

### 2. Register User (requires API Key)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}

{
  "email": "admin@handly.dev",
  "password": "Admin123!",
  "fullName": "Admin User"
}

### 3. Login → save token from response
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@handly.dev",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

### ===== DASHBOARD (JWT) =====

### 4. Get Project Info (JWT)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/projects/me
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### 5. Create Endpoint (JWT)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/endpoints
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

{
  "name": "Test Webhook",
  "url": "https://httpbin.org/post",
  "httpMethod": "POST",
  "timeoutSeconds": 30,
  "maxAttempts": 5
}

### 6. List Endpoints (JWT)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/endpoints
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### 7. Get Delivery (JWT)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/deliveries/DELIVERY_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### 8. Get Delivery Attempts (JWT)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/deliveries/DELIVERY_ID_HERE/attempts
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### ===== MACHINE API (API Key) =====

### 9. Create Delivery (API Key - machine-to-machine)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/deliveries
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}

{
  "endpointId": "ENDPOINT_ID_HERE",
  "idempotencyKey": "lead-123-insider",
  "payload": {
    "leadId": 12345,
    "name": "Test Lead"
  }
}
